{"4239120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nebula Miner", "steam_appid": 4239120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore space to locate resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probe space to find resources.  Resources are hidden until revealed by probes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/d00735bdeecee2278a2ce4857858440a.poster.avif?t=1776040944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/d00735bdeecee2278a2ce4857858440a.webm?t=1776040944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and claim solar systems to expand.  Stars are the hubs of your logistics network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/0402eb3e369c3457324431b7d26efe82.poster.avif?t=1776040944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/0402eb3e369c3457324431b7d26efe82.webm?t=1776040944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvest resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest Ore and Gas locations to earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/3c7c1f920ded9e3b9e5368c2be5d7f5d.poster.avif?t=1776040944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/3c7c1f920ded9e3b9e5368c2be5d7f5d.webm?t=1776040944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build orbitals around stars and black holes to improve your logistics and expand your minable area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/d6b47a14ee10360351ffe6fd867448a3.poster.avif?t=1776040944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/d6b47a14ee10360351ffe6fd867448a3.webm?t=1776040944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to earn upgrades for your mining company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission takes place in a unique nebula cloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore space to locate resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probe space to find resources.  Resources are hidden until revealed by probes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/d00735bdeecee2278a2ce4857858440a.poster.avif?t=1776040944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239120/extras/d00735bdeecee2278a2ce4857858440a.webm?t=1776040944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and claim solar systems to expand.  Stars are the hubs of your logistics network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb